                                "sense_id": "6c18ba83-32c8-37dd-a0b1-f1e49580c58b",
                                "text": "When she was in the room, the kitchen seemed too small and mean altogether. Miriam's beautiful twilighty parlour looked stiff and stupid. All the Leivers were eclipsed like candles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82555dfb-6d34-4ceb-84ad-9e5f11cf24d5",
                                "sense_id": "6c18ba83-32c8-37dd-a0b1-f1e49580c58b",
                                "text": "The air was hot and twilighty; but there was a nice smell somewhere. Bin sniffed curiously, wondering where the fragrance came from."
                            }
                        ]
